Release a surge of entropy, cleansing yourself of afflictions while draining the energy from others. All enemies in range 10 will have the duration of [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] beneficial effects reduced by [3, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, while you will have an equal number of detrimental effects reduced by the same duration.
